Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780.8,309.6)}{\an7}Manga\N{\pos(806.4,360)}{\an7}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Good work, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:06.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I heard good things about your reading sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've got the report ready, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:09.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:16.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:21.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're not submitting this report!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:02:03.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,403.2)}{\an7}Do You Love Cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:06.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NYou have to submit something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:11.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai and I talked things over,\Nand we don't want to submit this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cool, these pictures came out good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not sure if this'll work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:22.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,but we'll at least be able to\Nput together a good report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:24.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:29.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry! That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:36.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai?\NSomething's kind of bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:42.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I think I'm feeling the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:48.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like, is this really what\Nwe want to say we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:52.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're basically lying to the school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:03.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's not technically wrong,\Nbut it's definitely hiding the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I love cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:11.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it really something\NI need to hide from everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:16.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Personally, I don't think you do, but I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:18.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:25.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,When we visited those kids at school,\Nbeing in cosplay felt so normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:29.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:33.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just figured we needed to do\Nsomething to grab their attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:37.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't really think you'd take me up on the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:41.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just thought it would be a whole lot more fun for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:47.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like, when you see someone in cosplay,\Nyou look at them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,And it's not just us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:52.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cosplay grabs everyone's attention,\Nin a good way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:55.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,So why should we feel like we\Nneed to hide it from people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:04:00.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you told me our passion defines us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:04.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,and that gives me the courage to show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:14.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I see where you're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:18.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,What about this club room, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Without a report, you won't be able to keep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:25.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,You probably haven't heard of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:27.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,but there's a pretty big\Ncosplay event next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:29.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:33.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's at the end of May?\NOh, right, Yokosuka CosStream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's definitely heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:38.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:44.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're going to participate officially as a club,\Nand put that in our report!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's not going to convince\Nthem you're a real club!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:50.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:52.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:56.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how the outside\Nworld judges people who cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:57.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,So when are you gonna grow out of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.21,Q3,,0,0,0,,How will you explain that to your husband or parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,So when are you gonna grow out of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:04:59.83,Q3,,0,0,0,,How will you explain that to your husband or parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:04:59.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look at that slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,How will you explain that to your husband or parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,You just want attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:01.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,You just want attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:08.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Just submit that report and hide the less savory stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why bother being honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,That'll save our club room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:15.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,but we'd be losing\Nsomething else in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:21.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,What, your pride? Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:22.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can I get your new ROM?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll take a full set!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wow, we're gonna sell out before noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,We should've made more!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:33.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,This one was the best one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Any hotter, and we'd have to\Nslap an "18+" sticker on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:42.54,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678.4,172.8)}{\an7}NEW RELEASE\N{\pos(704,223.2)}{\an7}SOLD OUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hope this doesn't hurt my job hunt...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:41.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's... Something we can worry about later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mayura, you going to Winter Comiket?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:49.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've got a cosplay I've spent a whole year making.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's a masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:53.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,For real?! I can't wait to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:57.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I heard you got an offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:06:01.58,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,28.8)}{\an7}Congratulations!\N{\pos(192,79.2)}{\an7}You've been selected for the pool of incoming teachers.\N{\pos(550.4,129.6)}{\an7}Placement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:06:01.58,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,180)}{\an7}HIGH SCHOOL HOME EC
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:58.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:01.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're finally gonna be a teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:05.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so I should probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:09.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you're gonna show off your\Nmasterpiece before then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:12.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,It'll be your last Comiket as a student!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:18.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Uh... yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:27.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't assume people will take you seriously\Njust because you're serious about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:30.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,The world is a lot more complicated than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:34.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, then what do you think about cosplay, Sensei?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:39.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,What? W-what do I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:44.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I always thought it was too\Nembarrassing to tell anyone about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:49.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Even now, I feel a little embarrassed\Nto parade around saying it's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:54.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, if anyone asks me who I am,\NI'll tell them this:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:57.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I love manga. I love anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:59.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I love Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:01.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,And I love sexy costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Eri, she's way too young to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Crap, we gotta stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, sweetie, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:22.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is a softcore event, so come back\Nwhen you're in high school, mmkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:29.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she likes cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll see her around here someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:32.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Who knows...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:37.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, it would be fun to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:47.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sensei, the Manga Club makes, wears,\Nand takes photos of cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:50.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,And we want to be taken seriously for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:02.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're too young and naïve to realize the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:14.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,"Why did I spend so much time on something\Ntoo embarrassing to talk about in public?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,"But if anyone asks me who I am, I'll tell them this:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:21.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,"I can't if I want to live my life."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:25.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I love manga. I love anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:30.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,"I can't wear it. I'm a teacher now."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:33.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a cosplayer!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're so determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:43.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,"But it would be fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,How could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:48.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,...to see her again."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:53.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,How could I not support you all the way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:56.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,But you know what this means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:08.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,The Manga Club earned its club room\Nby doing well in big competitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:15.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,A picture of you two having fun at a\Ncosplay event isn't going to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:19.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who has to sign off\Non the report for the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,You see where I'm going with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:29.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:35.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,You'd better be the most popular\Ncosplayer there, you got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can I get this, and this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:55.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,and three of each piece of Kai-sama\Nmerch that came out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:58.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-I'll get those for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:02.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yay! You still had some left! Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:06.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,We've got tons left.\NThe blue one's the least popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:14.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kai-sama,\NI'm going to fly up the rankings for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:16.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm going sky-high, my prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:19.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's one of those cringe otaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,How is she not embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's pretty cute, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:27.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,You have a crush on a fictional character?\NBut you're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:36.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yup! I don't like 3D boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:43.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yokosuka CosStream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll be there, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's nice to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:53.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,But it's going to be a fierce battle, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:54.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:11:00.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,One of the Four Queens of cosplay, Nagomi,\Nwill be working at an official industry booth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:02.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:06.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,And she'll be a character\Nthat went viral last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:08.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Her announcement got 100k retweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:13.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,The fan area may be a ghost town, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Steel your heart for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:24.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,How's the costume coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:27.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You'd better be grabbing the accessories\NI asked for last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can we discuss the promo for that new game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can you talk while I do your makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:40.42,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,72)}{\an7}Prince Charming
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:40.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,The Prince C summer merch dropped today,\Nso I went to Animate first thing this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,That early?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:45.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,You could've gone next week,\Nand Kai's merch would still be available.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:48.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You wanna die, girlfriend?!\NAnd it's Kai-sama, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I fell in love with a 2D boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:12:00.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Since that fateful day,\NI've sworn off 3D men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,And if I want to be his perfect match...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:11.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,...I'm gonna be the prettiest 2D girl in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:18.88,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,108)}{\an7}Heavenly Queen\N{\pos(960,158.4)}{\an7}Nagomi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:16.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nice, Nagomi-chan! Love that smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Looks like this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:37.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,This one was pretty far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:45.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's also a way bigger venue than the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:47.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be industry booths here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-you kinda look more nervous than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:13:00.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, I wanna take really good pictures\Nwe can put in our report!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.79,0:13:03.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's not as fancy as a competition or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.71,0:13:10.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,but I bet if I can get some exciting pictures,\Nit'll more than make up for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:15.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't get any pictures of you surrounded\Nby that huge crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,but if we can get another crowd going...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:25.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-you want me to do that again,\Nhere, with way more people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:30.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,You, uh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:36.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,S-senpai, could you say the magic words again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:37.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:42.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You know, when you said my Liliel was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your Liliel is the cutest in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:02.38,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(588.8,50.4)}{\an7}more embarrassing to\N{\pos(576,100.8)}{\an7}hear than she thought
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:02.38,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,568.8)}{\an7}more embarrassing to\N{\pos(115.2,619.2)}{\an7}say than he thought
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not interrupting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:07.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Magino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yoohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:10.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:15.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,As expected, it's very quiet over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're in the right place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:25.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's already quite the line forming\Noutside the industry hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:29.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everyone is here to see Miss 753, Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:36.79,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.8,216)}{\an7}I'll be Icola at CosStream!\N{\pos(729.6,266.4)}{\an7}See you there!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:31.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,That tracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:38.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,as she's cosplaying character\Nthat was all over social media last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,She was hired by the company themselves\Nto wear a professionally-made costume,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:45.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,a feat made possible only\Nbecause she is a professional cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:48.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Today's battlefield is centered around Miss Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:52.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it already looks fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:54.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I hope you came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:58.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,'Tis always a tragedy when few\Npeople come to see your costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Truly, no sorrow can compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:05.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're gonna go change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:07.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Roger-roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:10.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Come, friend, let us scope out the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:11.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look, there's Nagomi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:24.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ugh, Kai-sama's UR drop rate is 1.5%?!\NDo they just want my whole bank account?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:28.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I got a bunch of extra Kai cards, wanna trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:31.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't treat him like that! And it's Kai-sama!\NAnd thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:33.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,All of them are Nagomi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, she's the one in the middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:42.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,The rest are from the company.\NThey're there to support their professional cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:46.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,A professional cosplayer... Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:54.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Were you that Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:55.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:15:57.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,My photographer showed\Nme the pic he got of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:07.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hi. I didn't post it online, promise!\NI barely recognized you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:12.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,You still looked totally 3D, though.\NYou gotta work on your makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:15.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,R-really? I better study...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,You doing Liliel again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:18.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:22.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,U-um, what character are you cosplaying as today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:26.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, who am I again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:32.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Icola, from that new game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,You don't know her,\Nbut you're still cosplaying her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:41.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's not out yet,\Nso I wouldn't be able to know anything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:47.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Pretty much every day I'm cosplaying\Na character I don't know much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I do it, 'cause I'm a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:50.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:57.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look, I know what you're getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:00.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's not really cosplay if I don't love the character.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:04.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing this to get famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a sell-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:09.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,"Pros" are just influencers forced to cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:17.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've seen all that before in my comments and DMs.\NNothing I'm not already used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:20.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't thinking that at all, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:27.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,There are tons of pros out there who pretend\Nthey love the character so they don't get hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:29.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,but I don't think we should even bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:31.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:37.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Because I love cosplay and cosplayers\Nmore than anyone else out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,When I'm in costume,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:43.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,that's the only time I can transcend\Nthis third dimension to 2D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:51.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I never want to stop cosplaying.\NThat's why I do it professionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:53.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,And I'm not just doing it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:58.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I want to wear the most incredible costumes,\Nand pose for cameras around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:02.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the most perfect\N2D girl the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:06.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Kai-sama deserves the best, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:11.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,So that's why you'll cosplay characters\Nyou don't know anything about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:15.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's right. I mean, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:20.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,You love Liliel,\Nand cosplay is how you show that love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:28.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I love cosplay, live for cosplay,\Nand show that all through cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:29.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:33.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Which one of us loves cosplay more?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:35.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Here's some advice:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:42.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be at the booth at noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:46.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,so beginners like you shouldn't\Nbother going out there until this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:53.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.\NPlease don't take it personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:59.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's not trying to be insulting,\Nshe just gets intense about cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:04.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hi, Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't think we'd see you till summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:11.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-we're not bothering you, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:13.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, it's who we just ran into...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:18.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Damn, Nagomi started drama with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:20.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call it drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:23.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I think I said something that made her mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.25,0:19:27.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Honey, she was absolutely trying to start drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:31.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, she really knows her stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:34.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could've asked her some more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:36.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like, how does she get into character\Nwhen she doesn't know them that well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:40.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's so sweet...\NShe just needs confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I get why that's a downer,\Nbut brighten up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:48.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's right!\NYou're gonna need the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:52.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,If you wanna survive the CosStream\Nchanging room craziness, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:02.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,C'mon, focus up,\Nor there'll be no space left for your suitcase!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:05.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yup! Cheer up, we're gonna have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:07.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:12.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I hope she's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Izu-chan, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't forget anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:23.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're done here,\Nso you can spread out if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:26.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:29.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,We gotta get a spot before the industry hall opens!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:36.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Come now, milord Okumura!\NI shall explain to you our plan of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:39.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-you already have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:43.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Direct your attention to the map here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:56.79,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,100.8)}{\an7}Parking Lot Area\N{\pos(883.2,165.6)}{\an7}General Traffic Flow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:56.79,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,252)}{\an7}Underground Walkway
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:56.79,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,360)}{\an7}Outdoor Photo Area
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:56.79,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742.4,410.4)}{\an7}Hall A
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:56.79,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,468)}{\an7}Hall B
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:50.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Regular attendees like ourselves are limited\Nto Hall A and the outdoor photo areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:56.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,However, most attendees with tickets are\Nheading to Hall B for the industry booths.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:58.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:05.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes, what we're fearing is that most attendees\Nwill leave right after seeing Miss Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:10.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,If so, then they will head for the\Nexit nearest to the industry hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,through this passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:14.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,That is where we will stake our claim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:21.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Few cosplayers will station themselves there,\Nand everyone will need to pass by us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:26.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,If enough stop for pictures,\Nwe will most certainly create a buzzing crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:28.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,T-that makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:34.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,At worst, we can aim for the time period when\NMiss Nagomi returns to her booth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:42.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,but we may need to prepare for\Nmost attendees to leave when she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:44.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,No matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:51.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Clash with the Heavenly Queens is inevitable\Nwhen aiming for the highest heights!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:56.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let us go forth, milord Okumura!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:00.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,We can do this, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:07.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,"So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:10.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Which one of us loves cosplay more?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:24.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cosplay Stream 55 will begin shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:24:00.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,388.8)}{\an7}You're Not Liliel!
